{%- doc -%}
  Renders an informational tag (Figma: Standart Product Page → "Gluten-Free
  Options", used there for the Gluten-Free and Arrives gift-ready pair).

  It wears the secondary button's clothes — white, a hairline purple outline, the
  same 12px uppercase accent face — but it is not a control. Nothing happens when
  it is clicked, and the file gives it no hover, so it renders a `<span>`. Reaching
  for `ui-button` here would put a button in the tab order that leads nowhere and
  invite a hover state the design does not have.

  The glyph is optional and sized by the tag rather than by the file it came from,
  so a 24px export and a 14px one both land on the drawn 14px square.

  @param {string} label - The tag's text.
  @param {string} [icon] - The glyph, as an asset name or a readable one — `gift`,
    `wheat-slash`, `Gluten free`. Resolved by [ui-icon-name].
  @param {string} [class] - Additional CSS classes.
  @param {string} [attributes] - Extra HTML attributes to render on the element.

  @example
  {% render 'ui-tag', icon: 'wheat-slash', label: 'Gluten-Free' %}
  {% render 'ui-tag', label: 'Arrives gift-ready' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- capture tag_icon -%}{% render 'ui-icon-name', name: icon %}{%- endcapture -%}

<span
  class="ui-tag{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  {%- if attributes != blank %} {{ attributes }}{% endif -%}
>
  {%- if tag_icon != blank -%}
    <span class="ui-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{- tag_icon | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
  <span class="ui-tag__label">{{ label }}</span>
</span>

{% stylesheet %}
  :root {
    --ui-tag-icon: 14px;
    --ui-tag-font-size: 12px;
  }

  .ui-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: var(--ui-radius-sm);
    /* Inset rather than a border, so the tag stands exactly as tall as the
       secondary button it sits beside. See docs/ui-kit.md. */
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 var(--ui-hairline-width) var(--ui-color-primary);
    background-color: var(--ui-color-white);
    color: var(--ui-color-primary);
    font-family: var(--ui-font-accent);
    font-size: var(--ui-tag-font-size);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: var(--ui-line-height);
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ui-tag__icon {
    display: block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: var(--ui-tag-icon);
    height: var(--ui-tag-icon);
  }

  .ui-tag__icon > svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
